    "body": "Released claim. The worker stopped before a fix was ready.\n\nWhat is done in the worktree (not pushed, not committed):\n- Geometry generator and mesh: examples/catalog/probing/probe-face/model/ (plain 100 x 60 x 12 mm block, watertight quads).\n- Build script: examples/catalog/probing/probe-face/build.camscript (Probe1 with PRB-0400, set_wcs 0; Face1 on the stock).\n- Pinning test draft: crates/app/tests/example_catalog_probe_face.rs.\n\nWhat is not done:\n- No red run of the pin was recorded. The cargo build in the worktree stalled for over an hour after eight crates.\n- probe-face.camproj and probe-face.nc are not generated. The local CLI binary was too old for .camscript, so the case script is unverified.\n- README.md is not written.\n- No verify or G-code check has run.\n\nNext step for the next worker: build camcraft-app tests in a fresh worktree, run the pin red, then generate the case with cargo xtask catalog --case probing/probe-face and review the posted probe section for the G31 lines before the Face section.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
