    "body": "Already fixed on upstream/main 79376144c by PR #3301, which merged while this worker ran its gate.\nThe case has its generator, mesh, script, metadata, project, NC program, and README.\nThe committed NC program contains the G31 probe cycle and G54 update before the Face cutting moves.\nThe catalog tests include probes_before_first_cut, regenerates, and rebuilds for this case.\nThe issue is already closed.\n\nThe two claims were posted seconds apart.\nThis worker's push was rejected because the other worker had already pushed the same branch name.\nNo second PR was created, and no remote branch was overwritten.\n\nThis worker releases its claim and stops.\nIts independent change remains in local commit bee59c29914f4adfcc66c07056f457c578fb9563 in worktree .claude/worktrees/issue-2874.\nThat change passed its red-before-fix pin, missing-case mutation, all 14 catalog parity checks, the catalog suite, the quick gate, and app clippy.\nThe first gate had a build artifact failure. Worktree-only cleanup resolved it before the green gate.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
